title: Reliability Caps
message: If you use this software, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Kayode
    family-names: Adeniyi
    affiliation: Quantile Labs
    email: kayode@quantilelabs.com
repository-code: https://github.com/Adeniyikayodee/Reliability-Caps
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
keywords:
  - geospatial representation learning
  - sequential analysis
  - participatory sensing
  - flood early warning
abstract: >-
  Research code for measuring what a single human observation is worth to a
  spatial decision, given a learned partition of the landscape. Implements the
  information bound relating a partition's out-of-sample reliability to the
  evidence one report carries about its part, the leaky sequential test that
  consumes it, and the experiments that measure both against satellite
  representations and terrain.
